 original character website(https://mazui3.net/), I would love to use it there, I will credit your name and twitter account, and also use it in videos related to my characters posting there.\n\nThe story is about two characters in an RPG game, main character(勇者) and his supporter(仲間). They suppose to battle monsters and save the world. However they are tired of killing monsters and completing quests, and they start to enjoy the adventure for themselves since they have save and load, they won't die as game characters.\n\nFor the music: I would like it not too slow (since it's an RPG game suppose to save the world), but not too serious (since they are just enjoying themselves), rest I will leave it to you!\n\nThank you so much!", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Garin_c_s/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "music", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1386874, "client_id": 2092296, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1642798568200359937%2FD7138wWY.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6df419fe5f9dba752c230f99a5d87d07", "srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1642798568200359937%2FD7138wWY.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6df419fe5f9dba752c230f99a5d87d07, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1642798568200359937%2FD7138wWY.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8893e791e829d1df135e72d45e37c7b0 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1642798568200359937%2FD7138wWY.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e9c876e5eb9557c26c617a1013899783 3x"}, "preview_url": "https://fcdn.skeb.jp/uploads/